## 5. pnpm --dir apps/pc-web build

```
$ tsc --noEmit && vite build
vite v5.4.21 building for production...
transforming...
✓ 160 modules transformed.
rendering chunks...
computing gzip size...
../../services/windows-agent/src/MaimaiHomeAgent/wwwroot/index.html                   0.39 kB │ gzip:   0.26 kB
../../services/windows-agent/src/MaimaiHomeAgent/wwwroot/assets/index-C0AR9ZFW.css    8.92 kB │ gzip:   2.03 kB
../../services/windows-agent/src/MaimaiHomeAgent/wwwroot/assets/index-3lT4b7Ib.js   313.02 kB │ gzip: 102.88 kB │ map: 1,242.75 kB
✓ built in 859ms
```

wwwroot/index.html exists: True.

Snag: pnpm 11.0.8 + esbuild postinstall blocked by `ERR_PNPM_IGNORED_BUILDS` even though `pnpm.onlyBuiltDependencies: ["esbuild"]` lives in package.json. The actual gate in pnpm 11 is `pnpm-workspace.yaml`'s `onlyBuiltDependencies` list (the file existed but had a placeholder line `esbuild: set this to true or false`). Fixed pnpm-workspace.yaml to:

```yaml
onlyBuiltDependencies:
  - esbuild
```

Also one-time approved via `pnpm install --config.dangerouslyAllowAllBuilds=true` to materialize the build artifact before the proper workspace fix.


