## 7. Agent runtime smoke test

Launched via `schtasks /Run /TN MaimaiHomeAgentT28` against a one-shot scheduled task wrapping a .cmd that sets `ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Development` and runs `MaimaiHomeAgent.exe`. (Necessary because non-Development hosts only see wwwroot when the file is physically copied into bin\...\wwwroot — Web SDK's StaticWebAssets manifest is loaded automatically only in Development. Production publish would do the explicit copy via `_CopyResolvedFilesToPublishPreserveNewest`. T29 will exercise the publish path.)

